WEBVTT

00:00:58.733 --> 00:01:00.619
And I noticed this in a very funny way.

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:03.860
I left the Kaaba to eat something
in downtown Mecca.

00:01:04.408 --> 00:01:06.846
I headed to the nearest
Burger King restaurant.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:10.626
And I went there -- I noticed
that there was a male section,

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:13.448
which is carefully separated
from the female section.

00:01:13.472 --> 00:01:16.083
I had to pay, order and eat
in the male section.

00:01:16.686 --> 00:01:18.480
"It's funny," I said to myself,

00:01:18.504 --> 00:01:21.308
"You can mingle with the opposite sex
at the holy Kaaba,

00:01:21.332 --> 00:01:22.976
but not at the Burger King?"

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.030
(Laughter)

00:01:24.054 --> 00:01:25.756
Quite, quite ironic.

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:28.047
Ironic, and it's also,
I think, quite telling,

00:01:28.071 --> 00:01:31.651
because the Kaaba
and the rituals around it